WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.128 --> 00:00:08.402
NOSHASHI reads the XRP Ledger and turns what it finds into plain answers for institutions.

2
00:00:08.428 --> 00:00:14.702
Everything you see in this video is read live from XRPL Mainnet. Nothing is sample data.

3
00:00:16.254 --> 00:00:22.635
The home page leads with two things: products that read the ledger, and research that shows why they matter.

4
00:00:23.947 --> 00:00:28.493
Products lists everything we sell, with the price and who each one is for.

5
00:00:29.894 --> 00:00:36.979
Continuity reconciles deposits. Rippling Exposure finds tokens that can be moved without your signature.

6
00:00:38.377 --> 00:00:45.931
Issuer Watch, Verified Issuer, Issuer history and the Ledger Evidence Report cover the token issuers you deal with.

7
00:00:47.192 --> 00:00:54.917
The API Console puts every API behind a simple form. Pick a question, enter a public address, read the answer.

8
00:00:54.919 --> 00:01:00.361
Every answer carries the ledger index it was read at, so anyone can check it again later.

9
00:01:00.364 --> 00:01:06.105
Read-only throughout: NOSHASHI never asks for a key and can never sign or move funds.

10
00:01:06.107 --> 00:01:09.181
The next videos walk through each product in turn.
